source. This does not automatically license separate applications it manages.
Paid implementation/support are welcome. Give the customer source, dependency
versions, build instructions, and configuration alongside their binary. Ensure
they control their repository, deployment credentials, and SOPS keys. Do not
publish secrets. GPLv3 also permits other compliant source-delivery methods.
